  "notes": [
    "**Reservar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Multiple meanings:",
    "To reserve, to book: *reservar una mesa* (to reserve a table)",
    "To save, to set aside: *reservar dinero* (to save money)",
    "To keep to oneself: *reservarse una opinión* (to keep an opinion to oneself)",
    "Common usage: *reservar un hotel* (to book a hotel), *reservar asientos* (to reserve seats), *reservar el derecho* (to reserve the right)",
    "Related noun: **la reserva** (reservation / reserve)",
    "Related adjective: **reservado/a** (reserved - both meanings: booked or personality trait)"
